flowchart LR
    Assess[Self-Regulation Assessment]
    Trigger{Escalation Trigger?}
    Request[ProfessorReviewRequest]
    BigLLM[Large LLM Professor]
    Result[ProfessorReviewResult]
    Actions[Suggested Probes / Source Audits / Regressions / Claim Ops]
    Authority[Mutation Authority / Review Policy]
    Gate[Metamemory Answer Gate]

    Assess --> Trigger
    Trigger -->|no| Gate
    Trigger -->|yes| Request
    Request --> BigLLM
    BigLLM --> Result
    Result --> Actions
    Actions --> Authority
    Result --> Gate
